WEBVTT

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.320
(Jacob sighs)

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:33.920
Stay here.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:37.040
(tense music playing)

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.360
(Lally) Oh.

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:56.560
Apologies.

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:03.000
Hmm.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:05.640
(Jacob) Oh, boy. (sighs)

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:12.680
(tense music continues)

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:21.240
(searing)

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:23.440
Let her go.

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:25.160
Excuse me?

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.000
(tense music intensifies)

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:32.400
(Jacob huffs)

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:35.800
-Assassin! -(Jacob) Huh?

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:39.320
(hesitates)

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:41.040
(Jacob grunts)

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:42.080
(strains)

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.600
(rumbling)

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:44.840
(bursting)

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:48.960
(both grunt)

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.320
(wind gusting)

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:55.920
(Jacob grunting)

00:01:57.920 --> 00:01:59.280
(cutlery clanking)

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:05.960
(ethereal music playing)

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:16.840
(menacing music playing)

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:25.040
(dramatic music playing)

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:45.080
(dramatic music continues)

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:52.440
(thump)

00:02:58.960 --> 00:02:59.880
(music stops)

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.040
(snoring)

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:18.000
(continues snoring)

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:33.640
Huh?

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:40.000
(grunting)

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:45.840
(yelps)

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:49.440
(dramatic music playing)

00:03:58.320 --> 00:03:59.880
(Pick squeaks)

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:04.280
-(Teddy grunts) -(Pick squeaks)

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:07.400
(handflute plays in distance)

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:15.240
-(squish) -(creatures screech)

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:18.280
(squelching)

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.400
(sighs)

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:24.920
(lantern tinkling)

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:27.440
(lantern clinks)

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:28.480
(creatures screeching)

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:36.800
(Theseus gasps)

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:39.640
(clicks)

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:42.640
(creature grunts)

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:43.600
(Theseus yelps)

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:46.560
(both grunting)

00:04:57.720 --> 00:04:59.080
(panting)

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.680
(snarls)

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:09.080
(grunts, shouts)

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:11.720
(grunting)

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:20.680
(huffing)

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:23.360
(grunts)

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:26.200
(panting and grunting)

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:33.520
(Theseus grunts)

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:37.080
No, wait.

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:38.920
(Theseus straining)

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:51.480
-(grunts) -(Theseus screams)

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:52.360
(Theseus) Newt!

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:54.440
(panting)

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.120
Accio!

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.200
Grab the tie.

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:08.840
(laughing)

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:13.200
-(lantern clinks) -(rattling)

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:14.240
(creature grunts)

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:15.840
(swift whoosh)

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:18.720
(groaning and panting)

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:24.120
(Teddy quacks tiredly)

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.040
(clicking)

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:47.600
That was a Portkey.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:49.200
Yeah.

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:53.920
Well done, you two.

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:57.320
(Pick chatters)

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:59.320
(enchanting music playing)

